        "text": "Anyone can create a crypto wallet and begin using DEFI services as long as they can access the Internet. There are no signups, no minimum account balances, or identity verification that TRADFI institutions require. This means DEFI can help improve financial inclusion by serving the unbanked. You probably heard about cefi, which stands for centralized finance. It's a world where financial services are managed by centralized financial institutions. I know it's confusing, but even inside the crypto world, not every financial service is decentralized. When we say CEFI in the crypto space, it generally refers to crypto trades that are handled through a centralized exchange. For example, staking tokens to earn rewards through a centralized exchange often requires users to use a custodial wallet and to trust the centralized exchange.",
